<title>BELGIUM: EU cuts high quality soft wheat, maize duties.</title>
<headline>EU cuts high quality soft wheat, maize duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Tuesday cut import duties for high quality soft wheat and maize, according to European Commission figures received on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Duties on transatlantic imports of high quality soft wheat and maize were cut to 17.88 Ecus a tonne, from 23.10 Ecus, and to 71.20 Ecus a tonne, from 76.27 Ecus respectively.</p>
</text>
